{"pageProps":{"tabData":["1-50","51-56"],"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000013483","bookName":"Revenge Puck","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000013483/42000013483.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":56454062,"followCount":1483696,"introduction":"Lucy has just been cheated on and dumped by her ex-boyfriend and hockey star Adam. She makes a deal to fake date his biggest hockey rival, Blake, to throw off his game until the end of the playoffs.","chapterCount":56,"labels":["Revenge","Contract Lover"],"tags":["Revenge","Contract Lover"],"typeTwoIds":[161,275,267],"typeTwoNames":["Romance","Contract Lover","Enemies to Lovers"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"},{"id":275,"name":"Contract Lover","replaceName":"contract-lover"},{"id":267,"name":"Enemies to Lovers","replaceName":"enemies-to-lovers"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Revenge-Puck","bookNameLower":"revenge-puck","shelfTime":"2026-06-02 12:12:10","firstShelfTime":"2026-06-02 12:12:10","performerList":[{"performerId":"12198","performerName":"Evan Adams","performerFormatName":"Evan-Adams","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x9/12198/12198.jpg?time=1786698794056","videoCount":9},{"performerId":"12024","performerName":"Hannah Lowery","performerFormatName":"Hannah-Lowery","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/12024/12024.jpg?time=1784165791631","videoCount":6}],"performerIdList":[12024,12198]},"recommends":[{"bookId":"42000024646","bookName":"Echoes of Eternity: Until the Stars Remember  ","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024646/42000024646.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":781,"introduction":"A forbidden love between two immortals sparks a curse spanning three lifetimes. Cast into the mortal world with no memory, he is consumed by resentment and turns on the woman he once loved. She escapes, raises their gifted child, and returns as a fearless warrior seeking revenge. When an ancient relic restores their memories, father and child become bitter enemies, while their mischievous little one schemes to reunite them.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Family Bonds","Cultivation Fantasy"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Cultivation Fantasy"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Echoes-of-Eternity-Until-the-Stars-Remember--","bookNameLower":"echoes-of-eternity-until-the-stars-remember","shelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:29:53","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-14 11:29:53","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000024157","bookName":"Meant to Love You Forever","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024157/42000024157.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":4984,"introduction":"After catching her fiancé cheating with her stepsister, Claire Grant has a one-night stand with his uncle, Adrian Foster. A month later, she discovers she’s pregnant, and Adrian proposes a marriage of convenience. But when Claire learns she’s only a replacement for his lost love, their marriage falls apart. After a crash leaves her childless and Adrian amnesiac, Claire refuses to walk away, determined to help him remember the love they once shared.","chapterCount":92,"labels":["Forbidden Love","Modern"],"tags":["Forbidden Love","Modern"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"Meant-to-Love-You-Forever","bookNameLower":"meant-to-love-you-forever","shelfTime":"2026-08-11 09:49:24","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-11 09:49:24","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000023838","bookName":"The Loser Janitor is the Ultimate Legend","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023838/42000023838.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":27385,"introduction":"Thirty years ago, Grand Duke Cyril ended an alien \r\ninvasion but lost his wife. He vanished into a janitor's \r\nlife, raising his son, refusing wealth or titles. After \r\nsaving a girl, he's set up with her mother, a tycoon. \r\nMocked as unworthy, he stays silent until he reveals \r\nhis identity, humbling his tormentors. The aliens return; \r\ncorporations weigh saving the poor. ","chapterCount":52,"labels":["Comeback Story","War God"],"tags":["Comeback Story","War God"],"typeTwoIds":[197,181,187],"typeTwoNames":["Romance","Revenge","Counterattack"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":197,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"},{"id":181,"name":"Revenge","replaceName":"revenge"},{"id":187,"name":"Counterattack","replaceName":"counterattack"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Loser-Janitor-is-the-Ultimate-Legend","bookNameLower":"the-loser-janitor-is-the-ultimate-legend","shelfTime":"2026-08-12 10:48:05","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-12 10:48:05","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000023201","bookName":"The Alpha Judge Who Lost His Omega","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023201/42000023201.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":25280,"introduction":"For three years, Omega Noah Lane gave everything to Alpha Judge Damon Blackwell, sacrificing his body to stabilize Damon’s deadly pheromone disorder. But when Noah loses their unborn child and Damon chooses his ex-lover over saving him, Noah breaks their bond and walks away. As Damon’s world collapses without the Omega he thought was replaceable, Noah uncovers a dark conspiracy that could destroy the Blackwell empire.","chapterCount":40,"labels":["Second Chance","Revenge"],"tags":["Second Chance","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[161],"typeTwoNames":["Romance"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Alpha-Judge-Who-Lost-His-Omega","bookNameLower":"the-alpha-judge-who-lost-his-omega","shelfTime":"2026-08-10 11:21:30","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-10 11:21:30","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000023823","bookName":"The Witch and Her Hunter","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000023823/42000023823.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":31466,"introduction":"Celeste was a normal professor—until she discovered she is a witch, forced to marry Declan, a witch hunter born to kill her kind. To defeat a deadly warlock threat, Celeste and Declan must form a blood bond and fight side by side just to survive. But resisting their dangerous attraction may be even harder. Then Celeste’s long-lost sister orders her: Marry him. Earn his trust. Kill him on your wedding night. Celeste must choose: blood or love.","chapterCount":48,"labels":["Forced Love","Revenge"],"tags":["Forced Love","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[161,267],"typeTwoNames":["Romance","Enemies to Lovers"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":161,"name":"Romance","replaceName":"romance"},{"id":267,"name":"Enemies to Lovers","replaceName":"enemies-to-lovers"}],"language":"ENGLISH","typeTwoName":"Romance","simpleLanguage":"en","bookNameEn":"The-Witch-and-Her-Hunter","bookNameLower":"the-witch-and-her-hunter","shelfTime":"2026-08-11 10:00:02","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-11 10:00:02","performerIdList":[]},{"bookId":"42000024160","bookName":"A Kiss After Midnight","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000024160/42000024160.jpg@w=240&h=400","followCount":7494,"introduction":"Clara Reed thought Ryan Hayes was the man she’d marry—until she caught him cheating with her stepsister, Taryn Davis. Heartbroken, she meets billionaire Victor Carter at a bar. Their night together was supposed to mean nothing, but every encounter pulls them closer. What starts as a reckless mistake soon becomes a love neither can escape.","chapterCount":103,"lab